  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2804.14 Correspondence. All reports, statements, and correspondence concerning administrative license suspensions, shall be mailed to:\n\nALS\n\nDepartment of Safety\n\nP.O. Box 27\n\nConcord, NH 03302-0027.\n\nSource. #8782-A, eff 1-1-07 (formerly Saf-C 2804.10); ss by #10888, eff 7-16-15\n\nAPPENDIX",
